OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm 'supplied whole
OL,4,Ahospital site over summer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA solar farm has supplied an entire
OL,7,Fhospital site with energy since April
OL,8,Fon account of the recent sunshine,
OL,9,Ftrust bosses have said.
OL,11,FBowman's Harbour Solar Farm in
OL,12,FWednesfield - which opened in 2024 -
OL,13,Falso provided roughly 75% of New Cross
OL,14,FHospital's electricity between April
OL,15,F2025 and March.
OL,17,FRoyal Wolverhampton NHS Trust said the
OL,18,Fsite further delivered an annual carbon
OL,19,Freduction of about 1,450 tonnes of CO2
OL,20,Fequivalent.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
