OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm 'supplied whole
OL,4,Ahospital site over summer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project is expected to save the
OL,7,Ftrust an estimated #15m to #20m over 20
OL,8,Fyears and reduce the trust's reliance
OL,9,Fon electricity from the national grid.
